      "text": "Across the 23 participating laboratories, the average standardized mean difference was 0.04.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7",
      "pos": 8,
      "text": "The pooled estimate in the 2016 Registered Replication Report fell short of conventional statistical significance.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
