      "text": "The pooled estimate in the 2016 Registered Replication Report reached conventional statistical significance.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9",
      "pos": 10,
      "text": "The depletion manipulation administered in the multi-laboratory replication failed to tax participants' self-control.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10",
      "pos": 11,
      "text": "The ego depletion effect is negligible in the general population.",
